#. Tag: title
#: man-amor.6.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-amor.6.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>AMOR</acronym> stands for <quote>Amusing Misuse Of Resources</"
"quote>. It provides several different characters who prance around your X "
"screen doing tricks and giving you tips."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>AMOR</acronym> podržava<quote>Zabavna Zloupotreba Resursa</quote>. "
"On pruža nekoliko različitih obrta oko X na ekranu dajući vam savjete."

#. Tag: title
#: man-amor.6.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#. Tag: para
#: man-amor.6.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&amor; is configured graphically, and does not have any commandline options "
"other than the standard &kde; and &Qt; options."
msgstr ""
"&amor; je konfigurisan grafički, i nema nikakvih comandnih opcija osim "
"sstandardnih &kde; i &Qt; opcija:"

